ates": [{"smiles": "SMILES"}]}` 56	- Output: `{"candidates": [{"smiles": "SMILES", "metrics": {"energy_ev": f, "converged": bool}, "model": "mace"}]}` 57	- Errors: `invalid SMILES: '...'` → fix SMILES; `unknown model 'x'; legal: mace, chgnet` → fix model name; `failed to embed 3D structure for ...` → SMILES cannot be conformer-embedded, switch candidate 58	- Where used: Stage 2, once per model (mace and chgnet) 59	 60	## run-xtb — semi-empirical quantum single point 61	 62	``` 63	bda run-xtb --in IN --out OUT 64	``` 65	 66	- Input `--in`: `{"candidates": [{"smiles": "SMILES"}]}` 67	- Output: `{"candidates": [{"smiles": "SMILES", "metrics": {"homo_ev": f, "lumo_ev": f}}]}` 68	- Errors: 69	  - `xtb binary not found; install from https://github.com/grimme-lab/xtb/releases and put xtb.exe on PATH` → install xtb and add to PATH 70	  - `failed to embed 3D structure for ...` → switch candidate 71	  - `xtb failed: <last 500 chars of stderr>` → troubleshoot per stderr content (structure/convergence issues) 72	  - `failed to parse HOMO/LUMO from xtb output` / `failed to parse total energy from xtb output` → computation ran but output artifact missing; switch conformer or candidate and rerun 73	 74	## run-orca — true DFT endorsement (only closing Top-3) 75	 76	``` 77	bda run-orca --in IN --out OUT 78	``` 79	 80	- Input `--in`: `{"candidates": [{"smiles": "SMILES"}]}` 81	- Output: `{"candidates": [{"smiles": "SMILES", "endorsement": {"E_hartree": f, "homo_ev": f, "lumo_ev": f, "ie_ev": f, "ea_ev": f}}]}` — ie_ev/ea_ev are vertical ionization energy/electron affinity (voltage-window proxies) 82	- Per candidate: gas-phase geometry optimization of neutral/cation/anion three times (r2SCAN-3c + OPT, automatic single point after optimization); spin multiplicity derived from electron count parity per charge state (even→singlet, odd→doublet); max 3 retries per molecule; CPU-slow (~2–3 hours per molecule), only at closing; forbidden inside the funnel 83	- Errors: 84	  - `ORCA binary not